    "name": "if. Security amount",
    "text": "if. Security For The LPT Between Lincoln General and Santa Fe On or before June 30, 2009, Santa Fe, as partial security for its obligations to Lincoln General under the LPT referenced above (but not as a limitation on those obligations or an indication of the amount of claims reinsured), shall provide security in the amount of $3 million."
