    "text": "Santa Fe may do so by either: (a) escrowing fimds in a Regulation 114 Trust Account (“Trust Account”), comprised of US Treasuries or other investments acceptable to Lincoln General, as security for pexformance of the terms under the LPT. These funds shall only be able to be withdrawn with Lincoln General's consent; or (b) obtaining reinsurance of its obligations to Lincoln Gerieral in the amount of $3 million with an A, raitd reinsuter abthorized as a reinsurer to do business in Pennsylvania,"
