    "id": "c013",
    "name": "if. Collateral following reinsurer default",
    "text": "Should the A rated reinsurer default on its obligations under the agreement, Santa Fe shall post. collateral (in the sate manner as if it was originally escrowing funds) for the amount of future losses forecast, ag determined through actuarial analysis performed by an independent actuary, at the expense of Santa Fe, whose selection must be approved by Lincoln General (but which approval shall not be unreasonably withheld), but the security posted shall not exceed $3 million."
