    "id": "c014",
    "name": "if. Release of Trust Account funds",
    "text": "If Santa Fe utilized the Trust Account, those funds muy be released if the market value of the Trust Account is greater than the total of Sante Fe’s estimated, remaining liability to Lincoln General under the LPT, as determined through actuarial analysis performed by an independent actuary, at the expense of Santa Fe, whose selection must be approved by Lincoln General (but which approval shall not be unreasonably withheld)."
