    "name": "WU. Funding of claims handling",
    "text": "WU. Funding of Claims Handling Savta Fe shall fund all activities in conection with the investigation, settlement, contesting, or handling of claims related to the 2002 GAA, 2002 0/S, 2003 GAA, 2003 Q/S, and all addenda to those agreements."
  },
  {
    "id": "c017",
    "name": "WU. Scope of funding obligations",
    "text": "It is understood and agréed that Santa Fe’s finding obligations shall include, but ot be limited to, al] claim payments, all attomey’s fees, other legal expenses, and any other expenses related to claims investigation, settlement, contesting, and handling,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c018",
    "name": "WU. No effect on other obligations",
    "text": "It is further understyod and agreed that Santa Fe’s provision. of such funding shall not affect auy obligations of U.S. Auto, Gamma, or any othér defendant in the Lawenit with regard to the 2002 GAA, 2002 Q/S, 2003 GAA, 2003 Q/S, and all addenda to thidse agreements."
  },
  {
    "id": "c019",
    "name": "IV. $1.5 million payment",
    "text": "IV. Santa Fe to Pay Lincoln General $1.5 Million Santa Fe shall pay Lincoln General $1.5 million."
  },
  {
    "id": "c020",
    "name": "IV. Payment installments",
    "text": "It shall pay this ainount in 5 equal payments of $300,000 starting on January 2, 2010 and continuing with $300,000 payments each following Jatuary 2 until all $1.5 million is paid."
  },
  {
    "id": "c021",
    "name": "IV. Promissory note",
    "text": "Santa Fe shall make a promissory note payable to Lincoln General to memorialize this obligation (in a form, substantially similar to Bxhibit A)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c022",
    "name": "V. Dismissal without prejudice",
    "text": "V. Dismissal Without Prejudice _ Upon, execution of this Memorandum of Understanding, which the parties agree js sufficiently definite to allow the parties to sue for its enforcement, Lincoln General shall dismiss . Hts case without prejudice as to all defendants,"
