    "id": "c024",
    "name": "VI. Tolling period",
    "text": "VI. Tolling The Parties agree to toll the running of the statute of limitations as to all causes of action at issue in the above Lawsuit or otherwise related to the 2002 GAA, 2002 QIS, 2003 GAA, 2003 QS, and all addenda to those agreoments, for five (5) years of until all claims on policies subject to those agresments have been paid and sctiled bétween the. Parties pursuant to any and all agreements between them (including this Memozandum of Understanding and any agreements MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING Page 3 85/67/2009 17:14 9722398512 PAGE 94/85 ee 2 ee ee oe ed * eee a PSs . tte et ote we at nla tdedmmend 7 eG ers Pa atte tats ght on tyes Is Be SA OGRE aE a . * Pe . se enim ted a eT a Uh: entered into sabsequent to this Memorandum of Understanding)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "VI. Other Causes of Action",
    "text": "It is intended that this tolling agreement shall extend to, but not be limited to, Lincoln General’s “Other Causes of Action” detailed in the April 28, 2008 letter agreement between Lincoln General, U.S, Auto, Gamma, CSi, Alpha, and Doug Maxwell,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "VI. Defenses and counterclaims",
    "text": "It is further intended thet this tolling agreement extends to any defenses, counterclaims, or equitable theories U.S. Auto or other Defendants axe asserting in the Lawsuit at the time of its dismissal without prejudice."
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "VI. Limitations posture",
    "text": "All claims, defenses, counterclaims, or equitable feories will have the same limitations posture as they had in the lawsuit prior to its ismissal."
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "VH. Regulatory Approval",
    "text": "VH. Regulatory Approval It is understood and agreed that this Memorandum of Understanding, and the matters to which it addresses, are subject to regulatory approval."
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "VO. Review and Construction of Documents",
    "text": "VO. Review and Construction of Documents The Pasties agree that the terms of this Memorandum of Understanding shall be construed as ifjointly drafted by all Patties."
  },
  {
    "id": "c030",
    "name": "Xk. Failure to complete required actions",
    "text": "Xk. In the Event of Failure to Complete the Required Actions under This Memorandum of Understanding or Later Breach In the event that the parties are not able to complete all of the actions required under this Memorandum of Understanding (such as final execution of the documentation contemplated herein, including but not limited to a mutually agreeable reinsurance agreement/LPT between Lincoln Geneml and Santa Fe, the settlement apresment contemplated by section X, or the posting of appropriate security), Lincoli’ sfremedy shall be to refile the lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c031",
    "name": "X. Settlement Agreement",
    "text": "X. Settlement Agreement See The Parties agree to draft a settlement ent to be executed along with the Santa Fe- LGIC reinsurance agreement that will, among other things, provide for releases of all Defendants based upon, Santa Fe’s satisfaction of the obligations in the reinsurance agreement/LPT, and of the obligations set forth in the settlement agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c032",
    "name": "X. Particulars of releases",
    "text": "The. particulars of the releases in Detentions favor shall be set forth in the settlement agreement, along with that agreement’s other tens."
  },
  {
    "id": "c033",
    "name": "XL. Counterparts",
    "text": "XL Counterparts This Memorandum of Understanding: may by executed and delivered in any number of counterparts, cack of which when so executed and delivered shall be deemed to be an original aml all of which counterparts taken together shall constitute one instrument and agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c034",
    "name": "XL. Telecopy counterpart",
    "text": "A copy of an executed counterpart delivered by teletopy shall bind the party exeonting thut counterpart."
  },
